      <rules>
        <rule name="Da Biggest Boss" id="963e-4d71-9007-a90f" hidden="false">
          <description>The Boss is so big, compared to other Night Goblins that is, that they may choose Strength skills.


If the Boss dies, the promoted leader will gain this rule.
No other member of the warband except the current leader may ever use Strength skills.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
