      <rules>
        <rule name="Wizard" id="f1db-7-6c18-6dec" hidden="false">
          <description>A Shaman begins with one spell randomly chosen from the Goblin Spell list.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Fungus Brew" id="9730-b096-1b9d-f6b9" hidden="false">
          <description>Before a battle, the Shaman may brew a special batch of Fungus Brew using 1 to 3 Mad Cap Mushrooms, and various other fungi they have collected.


The brew must be consumed immediately, and affects a single Night Goblin Warrior henchmen group until the end of the battle.


Roll on the Fungus Brew Table once for each Mad Cap Mushroom used in the brewing process.
If any of the dice come up with the same result, the batch is ruined and provides no effect other than a nasty headache!


FUNGUS BREW TABLE
D6  Result
1:    Rowdy: Affected by Animosity on a 1 or 2.
2:    Dizzy: -1 Initiative.
3:    Fearless: Immune to Fear and All Alone tests.
4:    Numbed: +1 Save which may not be reduced below 6+.
5:    Belligerent: Hatred against the opposing warband(s).
6:    Loony: Frenzy, followed by Stupidity if it wears off by a Goblin being knocked down or stunned.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Extra Equipment" id="608c-7536-e9c8-1a08" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="7" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="5a85-fc3f-554b-c5d0" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="0"/>
